{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a world where destiny, lust, and forbidden magic collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950120/extras/59f3c304980bd817a864af7d06d61074.poster.avif?t=1763233258\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950120/extras/59f3c304980bd817a864af7d06d61074.webm?t=1763233258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950120/extras/59f3c304980bd817a864af7d06d61074.mp4?t=1763233258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950120/extras/58ba0ae45f46ded2e7766f6a461cd032.avif?t=1763233258\" width=1200 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the grandson of a legendary professor, stepping into the academy to uphold a fading legacy. But behind the castle walls lies a darker truth: a captive goddess of love reaches out, begging you to set her free. Haunted by your family\u2019s dwindling magic and the mysterious disappearance of your grandfather, you must uncover the secrets that tie your fate to hers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950120/extras/6088d9aaa7a34ae131fd4e4748962e9f.avif?t=1763233258\" width=1200 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around you grows with every step\u2014an expanded magical forest full of quests, puzzles, seductive encounters, and even a dangerous troll fight. Exploration is never in vain: discover hidden treasures, collect panties, and unlock exclusive adult conten